// GAP-ZYB-006 — the exit status is a whole number, and `check` says so before
// the program runs.
//
// The branch that exits is typically the branch that runs least, so a run-time
// error here would surface on the day something already went wrong. It is
// decidable without running, so it is decided without running.
>> "algo" ¶
<~ "no soy un número"
